python3-sylkrtc (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Added sylk-account, sylk-addressbook, sylk-journal and sylk-settings tools
  * Added stereo audio to sylk-conference and sylk-session
  * Added music playback mixed with the microphone (--playback)
  * Added audio recording of conferences, mixed or per track
  * Added RTSP and ONVIF cameras as conference video sources
  * Added auto-answer, auto-reconnect and auto-disconnect options
  * Added headless mode and audio level and statistics output
  * Bug fixes

 -- Adrian Georgescu <ag@ag-projects.com>  Sun, 22 Nov 2026 10:24:00 -0300

python3-sylkrtc (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: SylkServer discovery, sylkRTC connection, video rooms
    with a GStreamer webrtcbin backend, and the sylk-session client

 -- Adrian Georgescu <ag@ag-projects.com>  Mon, 26 Oct 2026 10:00:00 -0300
